# Composition API

Introduced in Vue 3, the Composition API lets you group related logic together, making components more maintainable and reusable.

```javascript
import { ref, watch, onMounted } from 'vue'

export default {
  setup() {
    const searchQuery = ref('')
    const results = ref([])

    const fetchResults = async () => { ... }

    watch(searchQuery, fetchResults)
    onMounted(fetchResults)

    return { searchQuery, results }
  }
}
```

All code for the search feature is now in one place. Plus, you can extract this logic into a **composable** and reuse it across components.
